										}
									],
									"text": "Nodes: "
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "A node is a machine, physical or virtual, on which Kubernetes is installed. A node is a worker machine and that is where containers will be launched by Kubernetes. It was also known as Minions in the past. So you might hear these terms used interchangebly. "
								}
							]
						}
					]
